  "description": "EF Core integration for ResultCrafter ASP.NET Core. Maps an optimistic-concurrency DbUpdateConcurrencyException to a 409 RFC 9457 ProblemDetails via IExceptionHandler. Serialization failures and deadlocks (SQLSTATE 40001, 40P01) stay 500.",
